SUMMARY:Knitting & Crochet Circle
DESCRIPTION:Do you enjoy knitting and crocheting? If so\, join us on Tuesdays\, from 5:30 pm-7 pm. Bring a project to work on and visit with your neighbors. \nNo reservation required. Sponsored by the Friends of the Davis Public Library. Connect with us on Facebook at www.facebook.com/yolocountylibrary.org. \n\n 
